    "title": "Otters pick up bounce back victory over Wild Things - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n1 hours ago\nEVANSVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — The Evansville Otters improve to 18-7 at home with a 8-4 victory over the Washington Wild Things.\nThe Otters look to claim the series on June 2 with first pitch scheduled for 6:35 p.m.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
